msgstr "在%s中找到"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:140
msgctxt "web"
msgid "none found"
msgstr "找不到"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:141
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Which game it is (Steam app ID: %s)"
msgstr "是哪款遊戲（Steam應用程式ID：%s）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:141
msgctxt "web"
msgid "none"
msgstr "無"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:142
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Steam app ID, e.g. 1091500"
msgstr "Steam應用程式ID，例如1091500"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:145 title/pc5_web_page.html:171
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:257
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Save"
msgstr "儲存"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:148 title/pc5_web_page.html:174
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:260
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "正在儲存…"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:152
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Saved: its cover, background and details are fetched again when PC5 opens."
msgstr "已儲存：PC5開啟時會重新取得封面、背景和詳細資料。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:153
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Cleared: PC5 reads the game's folder again."
msgstr "已清除：PC5會重新讀取遊戲的資料夾。"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:155 title/pc5_web_page.html:180
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:268
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not saved: %s"
msgstr "未儲存：%s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:158
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "; GOG product %s"
msgstr "；GOG產品%s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:159
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"PC5 picks the game's cover, background and details by this number (%s%s). "
"If they are another game's, type the number from the game's Steam store "
"link (store.steampowered.com/app/<number>). Empty: PC5 reads the folder "
"again."
msgstr ""
"PC5依據這個編號（%s%s）選擇遊戲的封面、背景和詳細資料。如果它們屬於另一款遊戲，請輸入該遊戲Steam商店連結中的編號（store.steampowered.com/app/<編號>）。留空：PC5會重新讀取資料夾。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:178
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved: used at the game's next start."
msgstr "已儲存：將在遊戲下次啟動時使用。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:191
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Files: change a game's text files"
msgstr "檔案：變更遊戲的文字檔"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Game folder"
msgstr "遊戲資料夾"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Windows (registry, saves, settings)"
msgstr "Windows（登錄檔、存檔、設定）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:224
msgctxt "web"
msgid "This folder is empty"
msgstr "此資料夾是空的"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:235
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Larger than 8 MB: too large to change here"
msgstr "大於 8 MB：太大，無法在這裡變更"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:239
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not shown: %s"
msgstr "無法顯示：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:253
msgctxt "web"
msgid "UTF-8 with its mark"
msgstr "含 BOM 的 UTF-8"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:254
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Western (one byte a letter)"
msgstr "西文（每個字母一個位元組）"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:255
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"%s · %s line ends · %d lines · %s. Saved as it was: the same encoding and "
"line ends. A game reads it at its next start."
msgstr "%s · %s 換行 · %d 行 · %s。按原樣儲存：編碼和換行符號不變。遊戲在下次啟動時讀取。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:257
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "關閉"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:265
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "已儲存。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:273
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close without saving the changes?"
msgstr "不儲存變更就關閉？"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:278
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Wine writes its .reg files while a game plays: change them only when no "
"game is running."
msgstr "Wine 會在遊戲執行時寫入 .reg 檔：請只在沒有遊戲執行時變更它們。"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:280
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not opened: %s"
msgstr "無法開啟：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:283
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Text files only (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg and the like), up to 8 MB. "
"The console's File manager changes them too, a line at a time."
msgstr "僅限文字檔（.ini、.cfg、.txt、.json、.reg 等），最大 8 MB。主機上的檔案管理員也能逐行變更。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:294
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No games yet."
msgstr "還沒有遊戲。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:297
msgctxt "web"
msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "USB儲存裝置"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:298
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "無法啟動"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:303
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "設定：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:306
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "最新記錄檔"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:308
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "回報問題"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:309
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr "下載最新的記錄檔並開啟已填好的GitHub表單：請在那裡附上記錄檔。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:315
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "啟動選項（launch.txt）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:316
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr "第一個非空白且非註解（#或;）的行會加到程式的命令列中。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "環境變數（env.txt）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "每行一個NAME=value，在遊戲啟動前設定。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:321
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "額外記錄（winedebug.txt）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:322
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr "只在問題回報要求時使用，例如err+all,+seh。用完後請清空：它會拖慢遊戲。"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:327
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The games didn't load: %s"
msgstr "遊戲未能載入：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:340
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No logs kept."
msgstr "沒有保留任何記錄檔。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:344
msgctxt "web"
msgid "had a problem"
msgstr "出現過問題"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:347
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The logs didn't load: %s"
msgstr "記錄檔未能載入：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:356
msgctxt "web"
msgid "the connection was lost"
msgstr "連線已中斷"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:373
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Sending %d of %d: %s"
msgstr "正在傳送%d/%d：%s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:377
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Stopped at %s: %s"
msgstr "在%s處停止：%s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:384
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Sent %d files (%s). PC5 asks to install the game in a moment."
msgstr "已傳送%d個檔案（%s）。PC5稍後會詢問是否安裝這款遊戲。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:393
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Type the game's folder name first (no / or \\)."
msgstr "請先輸入遊戲的資料夾名稱（不能包含/或\\）。"

#~ msgid "Keep changing"
#~ msgstr "繼續變更"

#~ msgid "Vibration, light bar and triggers"
#~ msgstr "震動、燈條和扳機"

#~ msgid "Off. On holds the game at 30 fps and shows 60"
#~ msgstr "關。開啟後遊戲鎖定在30 fps並以60 fps顯示"
